:"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:11","title":"小红书商家找达人合作有哪些渠道?_广告行业问答_问答_传播易","raw_url":"https://m.chuanboyi.com/wenda/show/432.html","normalized_url":"https://m.chuanboyi.com/wenda/show/432.html","host":"m.chuanboyi.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:12","title":"小红书私域商家也开始投达人了! – 运营派","raw_url":"https://www.yunyingpai.com/xhs/961208.html","normalized_url":"https://www.yunyingpai.com/xhs/961208.html","host":"www.yunyingpai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-bf4b49c0327d49d5bbaa5814bde4d3fb:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","question_text":"商家有哪些寻找达人合作的渠道？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":24,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"5a980df4b9470d732acda62700a824312ad227a1539cfdeca1dc42efafdb8d67","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 商家找达人合作渠道（分4大类）\n## 一、平台官方撮合渠道（最推荐，合规、可看数据）\n1. **抖音**\n    - 精选联盟+达人广场：抖店后台，设置佣金，达人主动选品；也可以按类目、带货数据、粉丝量级筛选达人批量邀约，适合纯佣带货\n    - 巨量星图：品牌商单投放（短视频/直播广告），找付费商单达人，支持在线沟通、下单、报备，适合品牌种草，避免违规限流\n2. **小红书：蒲公英平台**\n    企业号入驻，筛选KOC/腰部/头部博主，可寄拍、商单，合作笔记带品牌合作标识，资金平台托管，合规报备。也可以站内搜竞品笔记，私信博主再走蒲公英下单\n3. **视频号：微信小店优选联盟**\n    视频号带货达人广场，设置佣金邀约达人带货，覆盖视频号、公众号创作者\n4. B站花火、快手磁力聚星：对应平台官方商单平台，品牌投放、内容合作。\n\n## 二、MCN机构/团长/媒介公司（批量对接，省BD人力）\n1. **MCN机构**：签约头部、腰部达人，适合预算充足，想一次性搞定多个达人、大型Campaign；可谈坑位费+佣金，由MCN统筹脚本、排期。\n2. **团长（抖音精选联盟团长）**：手里有大量中小达人资源，帮商家分发货品，额外给团长佣金；适合新店起量，批量铺大量中尾部达人，缺点要多付出团长服务费\n3. **媒介服务商/广告公司**：全域达人资源，多平台打包投放，适合品牌全案营销。\n\n## 三、站内自主挖掘（免费，适合中小商家、找KOC）\n- 搜索赛道关键词，看竞品投放的笔记/直播间，找到同品类带货达人，主页私信/商务邮箱建联\n- 直播间蹲同赛道主播，下播后私信沟通带货合作\n- 看竞品的合作达人，直接挖同款达人（达人广场有同行合作参考功能）\n> 提示：私下谈好商单，**广告类合作建议走官方平台报备**，避免限流、违规风险。\n\n## 四、社群、线下展会、私域人脉（补充渠道）\n1. 微信/QQ媒介群、达人招商群：群内发布品盘、佣金、样品政策，对接大量散达人、KOC；缺点账号鱼龙混杂，需要核验数据，刷量号较多。\n2. 线下选品会、直播供应链展会：杭州、广州等地的直播选品大会，现场对接主播、MCN、团长，面对面谈货盘。\n3. 行业人脉转介绍：合作过的达人互相推荐同行达人，信任度更高。\n4. 第三方达人数据SaaS工具：蝉妈妈、新红、灰豚等，用来检索达人、查看带货数据，辅助筛选（不属于撮合交易平台，只是查数据工具）\n\n### 简单选型建议\n- 新店、低预算：优先**精选联盟/蒲公英 + 站内挖KOC**，寄样置换+纯佣模式试跑\n- 品牌种草、要曝光：**星图、蒲公英**走官方报备投放\n- 需要批量铺达人：找**精选联盟团长**\n- 头部达人大型推广：直接对接**MCN机构**\n","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-d83ed7418cc240c9beffb86044872cda:1","title":"海外网红营销怎么做?从达人筛选到推广转化的实操指南_产品_内容_品牌","raw_url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1086794155_120701071/","normalized_url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1086794155_120701071/","host":"m.sohu.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-d83ed7418cc240c9beffb86044872cda:2","title":"微信小店成长中心 - 功能中心","raw_url":"https://store.weixin.qq.com/chengzhang/webdoc/wiki/1671/fd52d98dab79a925/growth_center_manual_for_store","normalized_url":"https://store.weixin.qq.com/chengzhang/webdoc/wiki/1671/fd52d98dab79a925/growth_center_manual_for_store","host":"store.weixin.qq.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-d83ed7418cc240c9beffb86044872cda:3","title":"你们做电商都是怎么找达人的？ #热门话题#电商 #电商干货 #电商人 #电商创业","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7638894207907015035","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7638894207907015035","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q0118","citation_id":"smp-d83ed7418cc240c9beffb86044872cda:4","title":"档口对接达人干货分享✨。今天下班在杭州遇到一位直播公司的达人，主动找我想尝试我们的货盘，双方交换了联系方式。 达人选品其实也可以从精选联盟挑款，靠赚佣金盈利，不用自己承担快递费和运费险，这些成本全由抖","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694697199314289009","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694697199314289009","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0118","question_id":"CQ-Q